WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.530
You really savor your food, don't you?

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.150
Of course. We're celebrating for Master.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.490
After that last battle, we only need one more chip.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.120
Winner, Teruto Kurabe.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.540
Did you see the smile on Master's face?

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.080
What?

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.790
The corners of his mouth went up.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:26.210
I'd call that a smile.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.670
I guess so.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.670
He looks for challengers on his own.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.840
He's really changed for the better.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.850
I wonder what got into him all of a sudden?

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.720
Have you asked him?

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.350
Sorry, I just remembered I have to go somewhere.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.270
I'll take care of the bill.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:49.270
Sakura?

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.690
You can have my food, okay?

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:52.900
What?

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.990
Sakura.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:01.370
Hey.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.750
You dropped this.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.580
Thank you very much.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:08.210
You're welcome.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.420
Sakura, wait up.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.560
One more.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:37.780
We have matched Teruto Kurabe
with his next opponent.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.540
One chip away.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:21.470
#09 Reach for the Stars

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:28.020
Ideal place for a showdown, right?

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.480
It sure is.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.100
Here he comes.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.480
Is he in grade school?

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.730
Don't underestimate him.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.940
Looks like he's just one chip away from the key, too.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:43.660
Then, does that mean he's equal to Master?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.990
Nice to meet you. I'm Mikhail Saiki.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:50.620
You're...

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:52.580
Me?

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.670
I recently met you at a café.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.880
Oh.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.880
This must be fate.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:05.890
Until now, the only thing I've sought
from battling is strength.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.270
Today, I've discovered a new reason to fight.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.770
If I win this match, please go out with me.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.110
Hiyori?

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.990
Declaring your love?

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.910
I'm flattered, but it's just not happening.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:32.500
My object of desire is
the cherry blossom tattooed samurai.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.870
Uh, well, um.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.880
Calm down, Hiyori.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.800
Miss Hiyori. Even your name is gorgeous.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.800
Deploying defensive barrier.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:56.600
<i>One more chip, then I can see the King.</i>

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.570
Twenty chips. All in.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.320
Betting them all?

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:06.740
Either way, only the winner can reach the King.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:07.950
Fine, me too.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.700
Call. Bloom.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.580
Call. Vertiga.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:16.580
- Build-Divide.
- Build-Divide.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.890
Up to here, it's been a back-and-forth battle.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.640
Raise your voice, let out a lonely roar.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.350
Accept.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.980
Vertiga, Valiant Frontiersman.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:45.150
Territory. Build Arise.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.450
Citadel of Lava and Snow.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.540
With Vertiga's appearance, I'll stand two Energy.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.450
Then, I'll use that Energy.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:58.460
Accept. Leptonica, Berserker of Snow Fields.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.290
Now, I'm coming for you.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.550
Using Vertiga to attack Bloom.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.840
Activating Bloom's ability.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.800
Checking the top of my deck.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.640
Shame. Looks like it wasn't a Buster.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.650
Bloom got taken out.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:21.650
I see.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.400
His deck is the type to store lots of Energy.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.860
Allowing him to unleash powerful units.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.950
Also, thanks to the Citadel of Lava and Snow...

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.790
If one of his units is destroyed,
he can leave it in the Energy Zone.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.500
Making it easy to send out reinforcements.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.170
That's a powerful Territory ability.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.000
Accept.

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:44.800
Goltopazos, Blazing Fire Dragon.

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:52.970
Until now, the only thing I've sought
from battling is strength.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.310
Then, I realized something.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:07:00.100
Strength means having the overwhelming power
to refuse succumbing to anyone.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:04.650
The winner's tale continues on beyond that strength.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.230
When Endive is destroyed, her ability is activated.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:10.070
Using a Command Card from
my opponent's Cemetery.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.410
Worm Hunting.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.700
Increasing Bloom's power by three thousand.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.040
This is it.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:21.330
Well, it's true that Bloom might be able
to surpass Granadiga in power.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:24.670
It would be risky to go after Bloom now.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.960
So, I just have to take down the player.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.800
Then, let's go. To our ending.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.680
Master!

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:41.810
Teruto!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.650
Up to now, you've battled magnificently.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:50.110
Even if you lose,
you should pat yourself on the back.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.160
<i>Me, lose?</i>

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.620
Until I reach the King...

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.960
I won't let myself lose.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:04.630
Brace yourself.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.920
This is where the fun really starts.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.670
Activating Bloom's ability.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.260
Calling Riverwort from the Cemetery.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.720
Then, Accept.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.430
Bertruga, Black Sword Dragon.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.850
Activating Bertruga's ability.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.400
Discarding a single card from my hand.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.440
Reducing Goltopazos' power by seven thousand.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.490
Using Riverwort to attack Granadiga.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.200
That's my Master.

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.750
Activating Granadiga's ability.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:44.250
By removing him when he's been destroyed...

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.670
I can send Vertiga to the field from my Energy Zone.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.880
Using Bertruga to attack Vertiga.

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.630
Activating Bertruga's ability.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.800
Removing two cards from my Cemetery to power up.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.480
Yay!

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.480
If I withdraw my units now, I'll still have a chance.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:13.190
I can't allow this tale to end just yet.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:17.660
Activating Leptonica's ability
in the Energy Zone. Accept.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:20.620
Activating Citadel of Lava and Snow's ability.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:24.370
Increasing Leptonica's hits by one,
then attacking the player.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.380
Shot Trigger?

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.130
Command. Cursed Trump Card.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:37.760
End of turn.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.390
Game over.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:44.100
He still has some lives left,
but he has almost no chance.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:46.940
I never thought it would turn out like this.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.560
Please tell me something.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:53.190
What does strength mean to you?

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.530
Strength?

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:59.950
For me it means never to lose sight of my path.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:04.620
Never to lose my way again,
so I can meet the King.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:06.830
I'm going to conquer my own path.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.750
Using Bloom to attack the player.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.770
Winner, Teruto Kurabe.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.690
I'll be rooting for your success against the King.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.330
So this is the key?

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.660
Congratulations, Master.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:50.420
Right. Now I can go to where Kikka is.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.750
You defeated me soundly.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.840
Someone like me could never hope
to win you over, Miss Hiyori.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.300
Mikhail.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:02.760
The next time we meet,
I'll be stronger than I am now.

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:05.720
I promise to be a man worthy of you.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:09.020
Please, won't you give me another chance?

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:12.230
Why are you so hung up on strength?

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.690
There's someone I wish to defeat.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:16.610
What?

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:18.780
It's nothing.

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:23.910
Um, listen, I happen to like strong people.

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:29.710
But not just strong,
someone with lots of comrades around him.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.880
Let's see, maybe forty-seven of them?

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.050
Forty-seven?

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:39.970
I hope you'll find some wonderful comrades.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.220
You're the wonderful one...

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:48.180
Actually, I should let Naomitsu know, too.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.390
We've acquired the key.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.440
It's all thanks to you.

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:57.440
I'm glad I believed in you.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.490
I truly appreciate this.

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:03.570
Your face doesn't match your words.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:10.120
I'm going to use this key to have my wish granted.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.080
What are you talking about?

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.330
Sakura?

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:25.340
I enjoyed our time together, both of you.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.060
Thank you.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.560
Sakura?

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:43.030
<i>Right until the end,
I couldn't bring myself to tell them.</i>

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.780
<i>The truth is, I'm just like Teruto.</i>

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:51.500
<i>When I came to, I had no memory of
who I was, or where I was from.</i>

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.340
Where am I?

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:04.470
It's cold.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:08.720
Who are you?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:13.680
Nice to meet you.
I go by Tatsumi Ishinome around here.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.440
Ishinome.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:19.860
Who are you to me?

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.530
Friends, I guess?

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.360
Friends. I don't remember you.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:29.240
Then we can just start being friends now.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.290
Tell me. Who am I?

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:37.040
What's my name?
Where's my family? Where do I live?

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.380
You're full of questions.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.960
Don't worry. I'll give you everything.

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:47.090
First of all, your name is Sakura.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.470
Sakura.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:58.560
<i>Just as he promised, Ishinome gave me everything.</i>

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:00.940
<i>A place to live, a social status.</i>

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:06.030
<i>But it was just deception.</i>

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:15.870
Why am I different from everyone else?
I don't get hungry or sleepy.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:20.170
It's not so bad. Why don't you relax about it?

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.000
My memory hasn't come back at all.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:26.720
The only thing I remember is that Rebuild Battle.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.720
When I battled the King.

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:33.970
Did I win?
Is this my punishment, how I am now?

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:37.270
Hm, I wouldn't call it a punishment.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.520
Give me a straight answer, will you?

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:46.110
That day, when you fought the King,
you had a certain wish.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:50.070
But we couldn't grant it to you in whole.

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.950
So only the non-physical part of you made it here.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:58.000
In other words, I'm just my soul right now?

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.250
Where's my body?

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.470
Neo Kyoto Tower.

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:13.350
Did the King steal my body?

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:15.760
Give it back.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:19.690
There are some things I can do,
and some that I can't.

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:22.060
Then, I'm getting it back with my own two hands.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.520
That's impossible.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:29.650
The only way to reach the King
is by winning Rebuild Battles.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:35.870
Since you only exist as your soul,
you can't participate in Rebuilds.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.700
No way.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:43.170
Does that mean I'll never be able to eat or sleep?

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:45.590
Never do anything a human would do.

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:50.670
Even now, look how sad I am,
but I can't shed a single tear.

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:56.350
Why do I even exist then?

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:59.390
I wouldn't think about it so deeply.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.810
Why not just live a blissful life?

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.770
I won't give up.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.650
But you...

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:14.110
I just have to find someone who
will fight in Rebuild Battles for me.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:15.620
I need chips to do that.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.990
You want me to just steal some?

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:21.460
You're partly responsible for this. Take duty.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:27.090
With such a desperate girl asking me,
I don't know how I'd say no.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.800
I'll find someone no matter what.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:41.140
Someone who will seize the stars for me.

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:47.060
<i>Since then, I consumed all my time with Build-Divide.</i>

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:51.990
<i>So I could find someone
skilled enough to complete the key.</i>

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:58.280
<i>But time kept passing without any Rebuilds being held.</i>

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:11.340
What's going on?

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.510
<i>I didn't have a moment to lose.</i>

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:22.100
<i>Just then, I was notified that a Rebuild was starting.</i>

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:28.270
<i>Then, I met him. Time started flowing again.</i>

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.040
<i>It's all thanks to you.</i>

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.420
<i>If my only other option is to disappear,
I have to do whatever it takes.</i>

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.260
<i>That's what I swore to myself.</i>

00:17:56.470 --> 00:18:00.930
Those who play with destiny, and those who resist.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:04.850
Seriously, humans are so precious.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:14.320
Come to think of it, the cards that were last issued...

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:18.450
I don't use black cards, so if you want this, it's yours.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.040
Then, I'll trade you for this one.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:24.790
Thank you very much.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.830
Hey, you guys.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:29.170
I brought something to celebrate with.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:29.920
Huh?

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.630
Hey, Teruto. Here's some croissants.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.090
What's wrong?

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.050
Naomitsu!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:12.790
She planned to take the key from the start,
and just used Teruto?

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:16.010
Betraying you two by pretending to be your friend?

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:18.300
Sakura isn't like that.

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:21.220
I'm sure she had a reason.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:26.100
But if she stole the key,
she's planning to battle the King herself, right?

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.250
She can't.

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:56.300
What?

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:59.220
If she battles the King, Sakura will...

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:00.840
We have to save her.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.930
Master, what are you talking about?

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:06.180
Even if she fights the King,
her wish won't be granted.

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:12.810
I've won a Rebuild Battle against the King once.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:29.040
I'm so disappointed it was you who came.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.540
Where's Teruto?

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:34.540
He's not coming.
I'm the one who's going to defeat you.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:36.000
Are you stupid?

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:41.300
Don't you see it's impossible?
I'm the King, remember?

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:45.090
Calling yourself the King, when you stole my body?

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:46.220
You're just a fake.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:51.890
What? You're just a hollow doll,
so don't give me attitude.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:55.520
Hey. What's with that look?

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.730
People must say you have a lousy personality.

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.440
You're both so headstrong.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:03.860
Not that I don't think that's attractive.

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:06.910
I'll overlook the fact that you pilfered those chips.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.580
Wait, seriously?

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:11.200
So I was busted anyway?

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:17.960
The plan had its errors,
but this is entertaining enough.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:22.260
Sakura Banka's request to
challenge the King is accepted.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:28.550
Fine. I was feeling bored anyway.

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:35.520
As you wish, I'll give you maximum torture.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:39.360
I don't have anything to lose.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:41.780
I'm going to regain what's mine.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:43.240
With my own hands.

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:46.110
Call. Iora.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:49.240
Call. Margreia.

